@startuml C4_Update_Operation_Plans_Process_View
title C4 – Operation Plan Update (Detailed Process)
hide footbox

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "Angular Form" as Form
participant "OemOperationPlansComponent" as Component
participant "OemApiService" as Service
participant "OemProxyController" as Controller
participant "OemClient" as Client
participant "OEM Validation Layer" as Validator
participant "OEM Audit Trail" as Audit

== Client-side validation ==
Operator -> Form : Fill status, dock, tasks, reason
Form -> Component : trigger onSaveEdit()
Component -> Component : Ensure reason/status present
Component -> Component : Normalise task times to ISO

== Server call ==
Component -> Service : updateOperationPlan(id, payload)
Service -> Controller : PATCH /api/oem/operation-plans/{id}
Controller -> Client : Forward payload + identity headers
Client -> Validator : PATCH /oem/operation-plans/{id}

== OEM validation ==
Validator -> Validator : Validate timings, resource availability
Validator -> Validator : Detect conflicts with other VVNs
alt Conflicts detected
  Validator --> Client : HTTP 200 { plan, warnings[], logEntry }
else Validation error
  Validator --> Client : HTTP 400 with errors
end

== Audit & response ==
Validator -> Audit : Append change log entry with reason & user
Client --> Controller : Bubble OEM response
Controller --> Service : Pass-through JSON
Service --> Component : Observable result
Component --> Operator : Show success, warnings, updated history

@enduml
